{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 14, :comments ["<b>יצפנו</b> — in their heart is the knowledge, that they not forget it, as in <i>in my heart I have stored it</i>." "<b>ופי אויל</b> — surrounds him." "<b>מחתה</b> — that was near to him on account of his folly, and the matter is that others entice him."], :book :proverbs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 10, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Proverbs -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/mishley/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:21:53.517146287Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}